 "remarks": "Welcome to 300 Broad Street! This beautifully updated 5th-floor, 2-bedroom, 2-bath residence offers bright, comfortable living in a convenient Stamford location. The thoughtfully renovated interior features a new kitchen with quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances and ample cabinetry, along with two newly updated full baths. The spacious living room enjoys abundant natural light and attractive views of the Stamford cityscape. Additional upgrades include new HVAC units for year-round comfort and the convenience of a private washer and dryer within the unit. Located in a well-maintained elevator building, residents also have access to an on-site fitness room. Parking is a standout feature, with two assigned spaces included-one in the garage and one exterior space. Conveniently located near downtown Stamford's shopping, dining, entertainment and transportation, this move-in-ready rental combines modern updates, and everyday convenience.",
